'''Niki-Bon Travel Agency''' was a store that supplied members of the rebel [[Axis network]] with fake identities and cover stories. The travel agency was run by the [[human]] [[Niki]] and the [[Bon's species|alien]] [[Bon]]<ref name="Friends" /> The store was located on an upper level of [[Coruscant]]. The business sign was rendered in [[Aurebesh]], but the name was incorrectly spelled as "NIGI BON". In [[3 BBY]],<ref name="Timeline">{{Andor|Ever Been to Ghorman?}} dates the second arc of [[Andor Season 2|''Andor'' Season 2]] to [[3 BBY]].</ref> rebel agent [[Cassian Jeron Andor|Cassian Andor]] visited the travel agency to secure a fake identity in order to visit the [[planet]] [[Ghorman]].<ref name="Friends" />

==Behind the scenes==
[[File:TravelAgency-Hull.jpg|thumb|250px|Interior view of the store]]
The Travel Agency appeared in the [[Andor Season 2|second season]] episode "[[Ever Been to Ghorman?]]" of the [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'' released on<ref name="Friends" /> on [[April 29]], [[2025]].<ref name="Trailer News">{{SW|url=news/andor-season-2-teaser-trailer-key-art-reveal|text=First ''Andor A Star Wars Story'' Teaser Trailer and Poster Revealed}}</ref> Niki-Bon Travel Agency's signage was inspired by airline and travel agent graphics from the 1970s.<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=news/andor-trivia-guide-week-2|text=Secrets from the Set of ''Andor'' Season 2: Week 2 Trivia}}</ref>

